WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
No, that's not what I meant

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,440
Isn’t this what the people on the school forum naturally said?

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,320
No matter how you say it, you can be considered your savior.

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,880
When you are discharged from the hospital, I will set up a bureau

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,160
Celebrate your survival

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,680
Invite Mick over then too

7
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,840
How about a formal thank you?

8
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,670
Then why not call his joke bestie too?

9
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,790
I saw that Song Jingyi’s photo on the forum

10
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,190
As beautiful as a fairy

11
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,270
We also know each other

12
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:28,790
Just treat it as a friend. I agree with Mick.

13
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,950
Can you come back from Qingming Mountain at night?

14
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:31,910
I had a stiff neck last night

15
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:33,990
I can't move my head all day today. Please help.

16
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,230
I've arrived at school

17
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:36,870
Where are you? I'm coming to find you.

18
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,310
Why did Teacher Mi come back so soon?

19
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:39,350
My experience watching Gongshan Picture Shop

20
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,470
The best thing is to pitch a tent and sleep one night on the top of the mountain

21
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,990
Then I got up at five o'clock to watch the sunrise. Now at this time

22
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:45,310
You probably didn’t even check the top of the mountain, right?

23
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,230
Memory sprained ankle

24
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:49,070
Mu Ye took him to the hospital first.

25
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,710
I also encountered something on the mountain

26
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:52,070
Just came back now

27
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:53,150
It doesn't matter anymore

28
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:56,930
Let’s go again next time, Teacher Mi.

29
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,970
They just dumped you on the mountain

30
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:01,450
Because there are three bags that add up to sixty pounds

31
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:04,050
It's a pity to leave it on the mountain

32
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:06,650
I'll fill up their time with them

33
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:08,650
Is it more urgent if the doctor is injured?
